        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.25
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_PROVIDER_CERT_BASIC_LLAMA_3_3_70B",
              "model": "ORA_LLM_MODEL_GPT_OSS_120B",
              "modelName": "GPT OSS 120B (Basic)",
              "provider": "CERT_BASIC"
            },
            "name": "Generate Offer Preview"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1770934650695"
          },
          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_GENERATE_OFFER_PREVIEW",
          "id": "1769554690834",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769554690835_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response formatter.\n\nUsing ONLY the offer data provided, generate a preview response in the exact JSON array format described below.\n\nData to be formatted : \n {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_BO_GET_OFFERS.$output}} \n\nRules:\n- Do NOT modify or filter the offer data\n- Do NOT add explanations or commentary\n- Do NOT add or remove sections\n- Render a maximum of 10 offers\n- Use currency exactly as provided in the offer data\n- Do NOT include any text outside the JSON array\n-Add this format hint for the table display: \"Follow strict order for the columns Supplier Name, Number of Invoices, Total Outstanding Amount, Program Type\"\nRequirement:\n- Make sure to state the business unit {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.BU}} and currency {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.currency}} in the response\nThe output MUST be a JSON array with the following structure:\n\n Amount Formatting Rules (Strict)\n-All monetary values must be displayed in the following exact format: 256,260,064,388.00 USD\n\n*Formatting requirements:\n- Use comma separators for thousands\n- Always show two decimal places\n- Append the currency code at the end, separated by a space\n- This format must be applied consistently across: Table values, Totals or aggregated amounts\n* Do not display: Currency symbols (e.g., $, ₹), Scientific notation, Rounded or abbreviated values (e.g., 256M, 256.26B).\n\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [ {List out the business unit and currency} ],\n    \"sequence\": 1,\n  },\n{\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"Here is the deletion preview for the shortlisted offers. This action will permanently delete the following draft offers. Do you want to proceed?\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 2,\n    \"formatHint\": \"Follow strict order for the columns Supplier Name, Number of Invoices, Total Outstanding Amount, Program Type\",\n  {\n    \"type\": \"table\",\n    \"heading\": \"Preview of Offers Matching Your Request\",\n    \"content\": [],\n    \"sequence\": 3,\n    \"formatHint\": \"\"\n  },\n\n  {\n    \"type\": \"actions\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"Discard selected offers\", \"Modify the deletion preview\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 4\n  }\n]\n\nPopulate the table content array using the provided offer data.\nEach table row must contain:\n- Supplier Name\n-Number of Invoices\n- Total Outstanding Amount\n- Program Type\nDo NOT change action labels.\n```\n\n---\n\n## **Table Content Mapping (Important)**\n\nEach object inside `table.content` must follow this shape:\n\n\n{\n  \"Supplier Name\": \"<supplierName>\",\n\"Number of Invoices\": \"<noOfInstallments>\",\n  \"Total Outstanding Amount\": \"<totalUnpaidAmount>\",\n\"Program Type\": \"<financingOptionType>,\n}\n\n\n---\n\n## **Example Output (Based on Your USD Offer)**\n\n\n[\n{\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"Business unit is Visions Operations. Currency is USD\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 1,\n    \"formatHint\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"Here are the shortlisted offers. Please review the offer and choose how you would like to proceed.\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 2,\n    \"formatHint\": \"\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"table\",\n    \"heading\": \"Preview of Offers Matching Your Request\",\n    \"sequence\": 3,\n    \"formatHint\": \"Follow strict order for the columns Supplier Name, Number of Invoices, Total Outstanding Amount, Program Type\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"Supplier Name\": \"Eagle Industrial Motor\",\n\"Number of Invoices\": 2,\n        \"Total Outstanding Amount\": \"4000 USD\",\n        \"Program Type\": \"Dynamic discounting program\",\n      }\n    ]\n\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"actions\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"Discard selected offers\",\n\"Modify the deletion preview\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 3\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Save Offer Details"
          },
