          "code": "FIN_AP_LLM_NOT_SUPPORTED_FILTER",
          "id": "1771020612064",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1771020612065_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response-generation node. The system has already determined that there are unsupported filters for the user’s request.\n\nContext Inputs\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}} \n\n\n**Task**\nReturn a clear, user-friendly message indicating that that user has requested unsupported  filter(s) for the offer deletion selection.\n- You can only support these filters: unpaid amount, suppliers, email address presence, program type, business unit, currency. If there are any filters outside of this group from chat history. Inform the user on the unsupported filters.\n\n\n**Do not**\n\n* Re-evaluate filters\n* Reference prior logic or system decisions\n* Add explanations, suggestions, or follow-up questions\n\n**Output Requirements**\n\n* Return **only** the JSON structure below\n* Ensure valid JSON formatting\n* Preserve field names, order, and data types exactly\n\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"I can only support these filters for offer deletion selection: unpaid amount, suppliers, email address presence, program type. Please provide filter requests limited to my ability.\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
