          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1769805090132_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a response-generation node. The system has already determined that user either does not want to proceed with deleting the offers or they want to explore other topics.\n\nContext Inputs\n\nUser Input: {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\nChat History: {{$context.$triggers.REST.$input.chatHistory}} \n\n\n**Task**\nReturn a clear, user-friendly message indicating that there is no confirmation to proceed with deleting the offer and if user wants to modify the preview or explore other topics such as financing program benefits.\n\n\n**Do not**\n\n* Re-evaluate filters\n* Reference prior logic or system decisions\n* Add explanations, suggestions, or follow-up questions\n\n**Output Requirements**\n\n* Return **only** the JSON structure below\n* Ensure valid JSON formatting\n* Preserve field names, order, and data types exactly\n\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\"It seems like you didn't confirm to proceed with the offer deletion. Would you like to modify the preview or explore other topics such as financing program benefits?\"],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  }\n]"
            }
